{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b283e07524b49514", "type": "tool_result", "content": "2604.14580\n===\n# TurboTalk: Progressive Distillation for One-Step Audio-Driven Talking Avatar Generation\narXiv: 2604.14580\nAuthors: Xiangyu Liu, Feng Gao, Xiaomei Zhang, Yong Zhang, Xiaoming Wei, Zhen Lei, Xiangyu Zhu\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose a two-stage progressive distillation framework that enables stable single-step talking human video generation from large multi-step diffusion models.\n  2. We introduce a progressive adversarial distillation strategy with dynamic timestep sampling and self-adversarial regularization, effectively mitigating training instability and quality collapse under one-step generation.\n  3. Extensive experiments demonstrate that our method significantly improves inference efficiency while preserving visual quality and audio-visual synchronization.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/功能-蒸馏加速, TTS/功能-快速生成\n===", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "36d4d21c-7ad8-4b5f-9885-63fc2635edb9", "uuid": "47fb8603-eeb1-4890-b895-89f42827f8ed", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:11:48.326Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "2604.14580\n===\n# TurboTalk: Progressive Distillation for One-Step Audio-Driven Talking Avatar Generation\narXiv: 2604.14580\nAuthors: Xiangyu Liu, Feng Gao, Xiaomei Zhang, Yong Zhang, Xiaoming Wei, Zhen Lei, Xiangyu Zhu\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose a two-stage progressive distillation framework that enables stable single-step talking human video generation from large multi-step diffusion models.\n  2. We introduce a progressive adversarial distillation strategy with dynamic timestep sampling and self-adversarial regularization, effectively mitigating training instability and quality collapse under one-step generation.\n  3. Extensive experiments demonstrate that our method significantly improves inference efficiency while preserving visual quality and audio-visual synchronization.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/功能-蒸馏加速, TTS/功能-快速生成\n===", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
